stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Normal: Launch Editor (Vim Mode Default)

    state "Normal Mode (Navigation & Operators)" as Normal
    state "Insert Mode (Prose & Auto-Pairs)" as Insert
    state "Visual Mode (Char / Line / Block)" as Visual
    state "Command Mode (:w :q :vsplit)" as Command
    state "Fuzzy Picker (SPC f / SPC s / SPC b)" as Picker
    state "Rendered View (Ctrl+P Native Preview)" as RenderedView
    state "Inline Embed Source Editor" as EmbedEdit

    Normal --> Insert: i / a / o / O / cw
    Insert --> Normal: Esc / Ctrl+[
    Normal --> Visual: v / V / Ctrl+v
    Visual --> Normal: Esc / y / d / c / > / <
    Normal --> Command: : (Colon)
    Command --> Normal: Enter / Esc
    Normal --> Picker: SPC f / SPC s / SPC g / SPC t
    Picker --> Normal: Enter (Open Target) / Esc
    Normal --> RenderedView: Ctrl+p (--gui / --ui Preview)
    RenderedView --> Normal: Ctrl+p / q / Esc
    RenderedView --> EmbedEdit: Click Embedded Diagram or Chart
    EmbedEdit --> RenderedView: Ctrl+s / Esc (Auto-Render Updated Asset)
